32	// this, so a pack's files never have to sit under a single shared root) and
33	// `local` (whether it came from a consumer's local_packs). A pack's skills live
34	// in its own tree — `<pack>/skills/<skill>/` is the one bundled-skill shape,
35	// canon and local alike (#385: a skill rides exactly one pack; there is no
36	// separate skills collection to own or cross-declare). A bundled skill's
37	// checks.mjs is gathered onto `skillChecks` and run by the runner only when the
