39	// A pack's declared adoption questions, validated: `questions` (an optional
40	// manifest field any pack may carry) must be an array of { id, prompt, distill? }
41	// with non-empty string ids and prompts, ids unique within the pack. A malformed
42	// entry is reported and skipped — one bad question must not mute the pack's valid
